{"count": 0, "rationale": "Every non-foothold step is reachable when no step is blocked. The target is an OR over vaultRead, mailArchive, codeRepo and shareMount, and it has two independent support chains. Chain A: fileServer leads to codeRepo and mailArchive. fileServer is an OR over sshKey, rdpLogin and ssoLogin. sshKey is an OR over iotDevice, containerHost and dmzWeb, each of which has several entry parents. rdpLogin needs containerHost AND tokenCache, both reachable from entries. Chain B: dbLogin needs dmzWeb AND tokenCache. dbLogin leads to jumpHost, which leads to shareMount and mailArchive. Blocking fileServer leaves chain B. Blocking dbLogin or jumpHost leaves chain A. Blocking sshKey leaves fileServer via rdpLogin or ssoLogin, and leaves chain B. Blocking dmzWeb leaves fileServer via sshKey from iotDevice or containerHost. Blocking tokenCache leaves fileServer via sshKey. Blocking containerHost or iotDevice leaves the other sshKey parents and chain B. No other step lies on every path. So no single blocked step cuts off the target."}
```

